---

<section id="about" class="py-24 border-t border-zinc-800/60">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 mb-2 font-medium">Background</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">About Me &amp; Principles</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      <!-- Bio Narrative -->
      <div class="scroll-reveal lg:col-span-8 space-y-5 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p>
          I am a software engineer based in Indonesia with a practical focus on backend infrastructure and complete web delivery. I care deeply about building systems that are simple to reason about, secure by default, and straightforward to maintain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Rather than adopting unnecessary layers of complexity, I favor clear architectural boundaries: well-documented REST APIs, predictable data structures, strong input sanitization, and stateless authentication. Whether structuring MongoDB collections or configuring SQLite for offline cashier environments, data integrity comes first.
        </p>
        <p>
          On the client, I prefer fast, lightweight interfaces using modern tools like Astro and Tailwind CSS. I enjoy owning features from database migrations and route handlers all the way to responsive user-facing screens.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Overview Card -->
      <div class="scroll-reveal lg:col-span-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 text-xs space-y-4">
        <div class="text-zinc-300 pb-2 border-b border-zinc-800/80 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[11px]">
          Quick Snapshot
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3 font-mono">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Location:</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-300">Indonesia (UTC+7)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Focus:</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-200">Backend &amp; Web Apps</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Primary Runtime:</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-300">Node.js / TypeScript</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Databases:</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-300">MongoDB, SQLite</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Mobile:</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-300">Flutter / Dart</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-2 border-t border-zinc-800/80">
            <span class="text-zinc-500">Status:</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Open to Offers
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
